###Conversation

###Create a conversation
POST {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/createconversation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "conversationName": "Test",
  "iconUrl": null,
  "memberUsernames": ["testuser2"]
}

###Get all conversations for a user
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Get conversation by id
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Get the members of a conversation
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/{{id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Add a user to a conversation
POST {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/{{id}}/members/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Leave a conversation
POST {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/{{id}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Conversation Messages

###Get all messages in a conversation
GET {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/{{id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###Send message in conversation
POST {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversation/{{id}}/sendmessage
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "messageText": "Hello, Conversation!",
  "replyToID": null
}

###Edit conversation message
PUT {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversationmessage/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "messageText": "Hello, Everyone!"
}

###Delete conversation message
DELETE {{Messaging_App_HostAddress}}/conversationmessage/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
